  "instance_name": "meme_culture",
  "label": "Meme Culture",
  "description": "This refers to the practice of creating, sharing, and interpreting internet memes, which are often humorous, satirical, or provocative images or videos with text. The meme format itself, including the use of text over an image to create a specific message or joke, is a product of internet meme culture. Understanding this context is necessary to interpret the meme as a piece of internet culture rather than just a random image with text.",
